{"ahead_by":50,"behind_by":0,"commits":[{"message":"retire leftover single-cell production deploy and RAILWAY alias\n\nLive npm deploy scripts already use deploy-topology.mjs. Remove the\nlegacy:render/legacy:all entrypoints, single-cell wrangler templates,\nand dead Cloudflare helpers that only served that path. Drop the\nRAILWAY_DATABASE_URL compatibility alias from production and docs.\n\nCo-authored-by: rhombus-agent \u003crhombus-agent@users.noreply.github.com\u003e","sha":"0025fdf16eb454e1f9f95b9898f00a11cf37deea"},{"message":"Remove marked legacy Markdown path and mdfn flags\n\nAlways render through the shared mdfn profile and keep the shared editor\nwith lazy @mdfn/svelte loading. Delete the dual marked renderer, per-surface\nrollout flags, and the client hook that existed only to apply them.\n\nCo-authored-by: rhombus-agent \u003crhombus-agent@users.noreply.github.com\u003e","sha":"a8e872f60b59c97293764f82ff9eaafa0451c2a0"},{"message":"Add pull request CI for cheap local gates\n\nRun preflight, lint, typecheck, unit tests, and the local adoption/boundary\nverifiers on pull_request. Pin Actions SHAs to match the tagged release\nworkflows, and keep install ignore-scripts with a reviewed esbuild rebuild.\n\nCo-authored-by: rhombus-agent \u003crhombus-agent@users.noreply.github.com\u003e","sha":"878a82f65c13d2e069df44fb95f9e61a4a06975f"},{"message":"Skip worktree preflight in PR CI\n\npnpm preflight requires sibling superfunctions and nucleus checkouts that\nGitHub-hosted runners do not have. Keep the repo-local AuthFn schema lock\ncheck and the other cheap gates.\n\nCo-authored-by: rhombus-agent \u003crhombus-agent@users.noreply.github.com\u003e","sha":"d7d6ce4f93d304caf9f7469d3dbe6f0dc57eec6f"},{"message":"Generate framework types before PR lint\n\nType-aware eslint needs SvelteKit and fumadocs generated types on a clean\ncheckout. Cancel superseded PR runs so only the latest commit is gated.\n\nCo-authored-by: rhombus-agent \u003crhombus-agent@users.noreply.github.com\u003e","sha":"34af573e919b91baa177ae803f38c76f63428910"},{"message":"Run cheap verifiers before unit tests\n\nKeep the storage golden-digest trap last so McpFn, mdfn, boundary, and\ndesign-system checks still execute on GitHub-hosted runners.\n\nCo-authored-by: rhombus-agent \u003crhombus-agent@users.noreply.github.com\u003e","sha":"c679649a7703a9f2c4f8cf9b04497b8a066fc1b9"},{"message":"chore(app): kill leftover client dead-ends\n\nRemove unused getSkillBundle and unused exported types, drop AppShell density and advertised command shortcuts, and keep workspace select plus PostHog init on a single path each.\n\nCo-authored-by: rhombus-agent \u003crhombus-agent@users.noreply.github.com\u003e","sha":"e860e8a54ed89c4f2f34fce300ece727e8fab8e6"},{"message":"chore: drop unused brand source dumps\n\nKeep only the icons each Worker/docs/UI surface actually links. Delete the\nunreferenced assets/brand and docs/assets/brand dumps plus unused 4096 PNGs\nand the unlinked app favicon.svg / opaque logos.\n\nCo-authored-by: rhombus-agent \u003crhombus-agent@users.noreply.github.com\u003e","sha":"9080742f417d3e87e10d6292a64cc5e28b1b1c3f"},{"message":"Sync MCP catalog source of truth with the live 39-tool surface\n\nShare one registered-tool inventory for the production gate, conformance, and public docs so composition/verification tools cannot drift from live MCP registration.\n\nCo-authored-by: rhombus-agent \u003crhombus-agent@users.noreply.github.com\u003e","sha":"f4f3ea2e8bc89cedf1b79d43492e92fcea8c1694"},{"message":"chore: drop unused package public API exports\n\nRemove dead exported symbols with no production callers: personalWorkspaceSlug, actionsForRole, roleAtLeast, trustDigest, the auth barrel re-export of createAuthApplication, the api ./health subpath, and registerOAuthMetadataRoutes on the api barrel.\n\nCo-authored-by: rhombus-agent \u003crhombus-agent@users.noreply.github.com\u003e","sha":"2d52176ecb6c859a7ede23752a8bcbb72b3a2cf3"},{"message":"chore(app): drop leftover SkillState, switcher, and layout types\n\nRemove unused SkillState conflict styling, WorkspaceSwitcher compact,\ninternal-only type exports, and passthrough skills layouts that only\nforwarded route params already available on page.params.\n\nCo-authored-by: rhombus-agent \u003crhombus-agent@users.noreply.github.com\u003e","sha":"4fbfc0438832e5285c95d5ae246c99be468b2515"},{"message":"style(app): wrap skill layout retry callback for prettier\n\nCo-authored-by: rhombus-agent \u003crhombus-agent@users.noreply.github.com\u003e","sha":"0a9ed7f763a407c244adf288d0ba022a3a7a4587"},{"message":"chore(scripts): tidy unit-runner and production smoke aliases\n\nDrop the duplicate production-deployment suite, delete Conduct-era\n--filter traps so turbo owns workspace filtering, fold release-tags\ntests into test:unit, and keep smoke:production:release as the only\nrelease smoke name.\n\nCo-authored-by: rhombus-agent \u003crhombus-agent@users.noreply.github.com\u003e","sha":"1a3d009dc61925c82d44b174b9ecc965b5661403"},{"message":"chore(app): adopt DS EmptyState/ErrorState and settings island\n\nCompose @skillplane/ui EmptyState, ErrorState, and Skeleton in SkillState\ninstead of local empty/error CSS. Migrate workspaces, members, and agents\noff AsyncState onto DS empty/error plus Button/Input/Select/Dialog. Swap\nAuditExplorer, AnalyticsDashboard, and the root error page to the same\nshells, then delete AsyncState now that callers are gone.\n\nKeep SkillState authorization (no DS equivalent) and the conflict kind\nso open #41 can still drop that leftover.\n\nCo-authored-by: rhombus-agent \u003crhombus-agent@users.noreply.github.com\u003e","sha":"27ca0febfd19a5d965ad05aa4a20aac7718e0c6d"},{"message":"fix(app): wrap DS Input/Select so grid forms keep one field per cell\n\nInput and Select render label and control as siblings. Place them in a\nsingle grid/flex item so agent, invite, member-role, and workspace forms\ndo not split a field across columns.\n\nCo-authored-by: rhombus-agent \u003crhombus-agent@users.noreply.github.com\u003e","sha":"37cfd82eacef68e9e40a4a7a6b092879a8e66da2"},{"message":"fix(app): keep pending buttons disabled and restore error status\n\nDS Button loading does not disable the native control. Restore disabled\nguards (and handler early-returns) on workspace, invite, revoke, and\ncredential mutations so overlapping submits cannot fire. Show page.status\nbeside ErrorState on the root error page.\n\nCo-authored-by: rhombus-agent \u003crhombus-agent@users.noreply.github.com\u003e","sha":"3e0cf02269152f0bfbb9fc031102dbef0fd03012"},{"message":"fix(app): keep one-time agent secret after incidental dialog close\n\nDS Dialog Escape, backdrop, and close no longer destroy the newly issued\ncredential. The secret stays until explicit acknowledgement, and if the\ndialog is dismissed it remains on the page so it can still be copied.\n\nCo-authored-by: rhombus-agent \u003crhombus-agent@users.noreply.github.com\u003e","sha":"a564237551fc64a7d655e335a15d9c0a1eaf3325"},{"message":"fix(app): block issuing another agent secret until the current one is saved\n\nCreate and rotate both write the one-time credential into a single\nvariable. While that secret is still on screen, disable those flows and\nreject them in handlers so a second issue cannot replace the only copy.\n\nCo-authored-by: rhombus-agent \u003crhombus-agent@users.noreply.github.com\u003e","sha":"15378560cc7d76c8176767ec8dc46a76a112a8be"},{"message":"fix(app): drop dead secretPending check inside gated create form\n\nThe create card is not rendered while a secret is pending, so the extra\ndisabled condition was always falsy.\n\nCo-authored-by: rhombus-agent \u003crhombus-agent@users.noreply.github.com\u003e","sha":"8a38b4e8a97d5aa222082b99c0229e2d0f60c5ff"},{"message":"fix(app): keep generic API errors off field Inputs\n\nInvitation and workspace failures use Input.error only when the API names\na field; other failures stay a form-level alert. Member-removal copy