{"baseRefName":"main","body":"Workspace owners and admins can organize skills and existing members into flat, many-to-many skill groups, edit or archive/restore groups, and filter catalog discovery by group. Group membership is organizational and preserves existing workspace authorization.\n\nAdds regional tables with migration fencing, same-workspace constraints, audited idempotent mutations, revision checks, paginated APIs, group management UI, and group badges on skill/member views. Existing ungrouped discovery remains unchanged. Apply regional/combined migration 0052 before running the new application; global identity remains in the control database.\n\nValidation: full lint and typecheck; API/app builds; 178 domain/API/app unit tests; 5 group domain checks and 12 API/search regression checks against an isolated Postgres database; browser create/archive/restore flow. Temporary verification helpers and .conduct changes are excluded; .gitignore is unchanged.\n\nCloses SKI-11.\n\n<!-- codesmith:footer -->\n---\n<a href=\"https://app.blacksmith.sh/21nCo/codesmith/skillplane/pr/46?autoLogin=true&ref=codesmith_pr_footer\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/view-with-codesmith-dark-v2.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/view-with-codesmith-light-v2.svg\"><img alt=\"View with [code]smith\" src=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/view-with-codesmith-dark-v2.svg\"></picture></a> <a href=\"https://backend.blacksmith.sh/track/enable-autofix?expires=1793924193&installation_model_id=437494&pr_number=46&ref=codesmith_pr_footer&repository=21nCo%2Fskillplane&return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2F21nCo%2Fskillplane%2Fpull%2F46&signature=8602945b1c856260229fc3e940ff764b5cfdbdcd187368b1be872d906264976f\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-light.svg\"><img alt=\"Autofix with [code]smith\" src=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark.svg\"></picture></a>\n<sup>Need help on this PR? Tag <code>@codesmith-bot</code> with what you need. Autofix is disabled.</sup>\n\n<!-- codesmith:autofix:disabled -->\n<!-- /codesmith:footer -->\n\n## Summary by Sourcery\n\nIntroduce workspace skill groups for organizing skills and members, with management APIs, discovery filters, user interface support, and regional persistence.\n\nNew Features:\n- Add workspace skill groups that organize skills and current members through many-to-many assignments without changing authorization.\n- Provide owner/admin APIs and UI for group creation, editing, archiving, restoring, assignment management, and paginated discovery.\n- Enable group filtering in skill catalog search and display group links on skill and member views.\n\nEnhancements:\n- Preserve tenant isolation and workspace membership validation for group operations, including archived-group behavior and stale revision protection.\n- Record idempotent, audited group mutations and assignments with migration fencing support.\n\nDeployment:\n- Add regional skill-group tables and migration ownership support, requiring migration 0052 before enabling the feature.\n\nDocumentation:\n- Document skill-group behavior, API endpoints, authorization boundaries, migration requirements, and rollback expectations.\n\nTests:\n- Add domain and API integration coverage for lifecycle operations, assignments, pagination, authorization, idempotency, archival, search filtering, tenant isolation, auditing, and migration fencing.\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated description by cubic. -->\n---\n## Summary by cubic\nAdds workspace skill groups so owners and admins can organize skills and existing members into flat, many-to-many groups, edit or archive/restore groups, and filter the skill catalog by group. Group membership is purely organizational and does not change workspace authorization.\n\nNew tables are regional and fenced, with audited idempotent mutations, revision checks, paginated APIs, and group management UI plus badges on skill and member views. Existing ungrouped discovery is unchanged. Apply migration `0052_regional_skill_groups.sql` to regional and combined databases before running the new application.\n\n<sup>Written for commit 6ef48c417d52e12e5f449ae81670422ab9a8a9ca. Summary will update on new commits.</sup>\n\n<a href=\"https://cubic.dev/pr/21nCo/skillplane/pull/46?utm_source=github\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" data-no-image-dialog=\"true\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://www.cubic.dev/buttons/review-in-cubic-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://www.cubic.dev/buttons/review-in-cubic-light.svg\"><img alt=\"Review in cubic\" src=\"https://www.cubic.dev/buttons/review-in-cubic-dark.svg\"></picture></a> <a href=\"https://www.cubic.dev/action/auto-fix/pr/21nCo/skillplane/46?returnTo=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2F21nCo%2Fskillplane%2Fpull%2F46&source=description\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" data-no-image-dialog=\"true\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://www.cubic.dev/buttons/turn-on-auto-fix-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://www.cubic.dev/buttons/turn-on-auto-fix-light.svg\"><img alt=\"Turn on auto-fix\" src=\"https://www.cubic.dev/buttons/turn-on-auto-fix-dark.svg\"></picture></a>\n\n<!-- End of auto-generated description by cubic. -->\n\n\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n* **New Features**\n  * Organize workspace skills into groups, add or remove skills and members, and archive or restore groups. Workspace owners and admins can manage groups.\n  * Filter the skills catalog by group, and see group links on skill and member pages.\n  * Browse groups from the workspace navigation, with support for searching and loading more results.\n* **Documentation**\n  * Added guidance on managing skill groups and their behavior.\n\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->","headRefName":"codex/ski-11-skill-groups","headRefOid":"6ef48c417d52e12e5f449ae81670422ab9a8a9ca","title":"SKI-11: Add workspace skill groups and member assignments","url":"https://github.com/21nCo/skillplane/pull/46"}
