ing members into flat, many-to-many groups, edit or archive/restore groups, and filter the skill catalog by group. Group membership is purely organizational and does not change workspace authorization.\n\nNew tables are regional and fenced, with audited idempotent mutations, revision checks, paginated APIs, and group management UI plus badges on skill and member views. Existing ungrouped discovery is unchanged. Apply migration `0052_regional_skill_groups.sql` to regional and combined databases before running the new application.\n\n<sup>Written for commit 6ef48c417d52e12e5f449ae81670422ab9a8a9ca. Summary will update on new commits.</sup>\n\n<a href=\"https://cubic.dev/pr/21nCo/skillplane/pull/46?utm_source=github\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" data-no-image-dialog=\"true\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://www.cubic.dev/buttons/review-in-cubic-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://www.cubic.dev/buttons/review-in-cubic-light.svg\"><img alt=\"Review in cubic\" src=\"https://www.cubic.dev/buttons/review-in-cubic-dark.svg\"></picture></a> <a href=\"https://www.cubic.dev/action/auto-fix/pr/21nCo/skillplane/46?returnTo=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2F21nCo%2Fskillplane%2Fpull%2F46&source=description\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" data-no-image-dialog=\"true\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://www.cubic.dev/buttons/turn-on-auto-fix-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://www.cubic.dev/buttons/turn-on-auto-fix-light.svg\"><img alt=\"Turn on auto-fix\" src=\"https://www.cubic.dev/buttons/turn-on-auto-fix-dark.svg\"></picture></a>\n\n<!-- End of auto-generated description by cubic. -->\n\n\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n* **New Features**\n  * Organize workspace skills into groups, add or remove skills and members, and archive or restore groups. Workspace owners and admins can manage groups.\n  * Filter the skills catalog by group, and see group links on skill and member pages.\n  * Browse groups from the workspace navigation, with support for searching and loading more results.\n* **Documentation**\n  * Added guidance on managing skill groups and their behavior.\n\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->","headRefName":"codex/ski-11-skill-groups","headRefOid":"6ef48c417d52e12e5f449ae81670422ab9a8a9ca","title":"SKI-11: Add workspace skill groups and member assignments","url":"https://github.com/21nCo/skillplane/pull/46"}
